{"parents": [], "prev": null, "next": {"link": "reference/auth_server/server_client/", "title": "Server Client"}, "title": "auth0-server-python", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"auth0-server-python\">\n<h1>auth0-server-python<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0-server-python\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Auth0 server-side Python SDK: authentication flows, token management, and session handling\nfor web applications.</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<p class=\"caption\" role=\"heading\"><span class=\"caption-text\">API Reference</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_server/server_client/\">Server Client</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_server/anonymous/client/\">Client</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_server/mfa_client/\">Mfa Client</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_server/my_account_client/\">My Account Client</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_server/passwordless_client/\">Passwordless Client</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_schemes/bearer_auth/\">Bearer Auth</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_schemes/dpop_auth/\">Dpop Auth</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_schemes/client_assertion/\">Client Assertion</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/auth_types/\">Auth Types</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/store/abstract/\">Abstract</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/encryption/encrypt/\">Encrypt</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/error/\">Error</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/utils/helpers/\">Helpers</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"reference/telemetry/\">Telemetry</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_server/server_client/index", "Server Client", "N", "next"]], "sourcename": "index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth0-server-python</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/ethical-ads.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html", "sidebar/variant-selector.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#f2f2f2", "foreground": "#1e1e1e"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}